{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/Banner.png?t=1741161758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>3D anime</strong> game based on <strong>exhibitionism.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/firstgidf_.gif?t=1741161758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Roxanne\u00a0</i></strong><i>was a\u00a0shy\u00a0and\u00a0reserved\u00a0girl, but she had a secret passion that made her feel alive:\u00a0<strong>she loved exhibitionism.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>She loved the\u00a0<strong>feeling of freedom</strong>\u00a0she felt when she walked\u00a0<strong>naked\u00a0</strong>down the street, feeling seen by anyone who passed by.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Of course, it wasn't an easy thing to do. She had to be very\u00a0<strong>careful\u00a0</strong>and always take the necessary\u00a0precautions\u00a0not to be\u00a0<strong>caught</strong>. But Roxanne knew it was something she wanted to do. And so she continued to do it, more and more often.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>More coming soon...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/CrawlGif.gif?t=1741161758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/cover.png?t=1741161758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as Roxanne, an exhibitionist girl!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>6 maps</strong> to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than <strong>66 clothes already available</strong> in the game including: <strong>underwear, swimsuits, accessories, shoes and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roxanne's basic customization</strong>, will improve in the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exp earning system with <strong>quests</strong>\u00a0 already available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hot live streaming money earning system</strong>, the more you <strong>expose yourself</strong> the more you earn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photo mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of <strong>secret images</strong> to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An entire <strong>in-game social network</strong> where you can <strong>post photos.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secondary characters</strong> you can interact with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Much more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/sun_.gif?t=1741161758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game based on <strong>exhibitionism </strong>and <strong>humiliation</strong>. Sex is not part of the foundation of the genre so <strong>it is not currently included</strong>. We plan to put it in a <strong>separate mode </strong>in the future but we still have to decide how and when. So I would like to ask you <strong>not to play the game if you are not a fan of this genre</strong>, you won't find anything exciting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552790?t=1741161758","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552790?t=1741161758","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps